# Soundcharts credentials for the live P2 harvest (T062).
#
# HOW TO USE (your real key NEVER goes on GitHub):
#   1. Copy this file to the gitignored location:
#        cp music_dataset_generator/soundcharts.env.example generation_workspace/soundcharts.env
#      (the whole generation_workspace/ tree is gitignored, so that copy can never be committed)
#   2. Put your real credentials in generation_workspace/soundcharts.env (replace the placeholders).
#   3. Run the live commands normally — `mdg probe` / `mdg harvest` read them automatically.
#
# Do NOT put a real key in THIS file — this .example template IS committed.
# An explicit `export SOUNDCHARTS_APP_ID=...` in your shell always overrides the file.

SOUNDCHARTS_APP_ID=your-app-id-here
SOUNDCHARTS_API_KEY=your-api-key-here
